"value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5402010","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2890610-1846651706692413","game_id":"steam-2890610","kind":"update","title":"Late Shate X Next Fest - Demo Patch","summary":"Hi everyone!The response to Late Shift has been incredible, and I'm so thankful for everyone who has decided to spend time in the Townsville Cinema! With that, Late Shift will be joining this October's Steam Next Fest.There have been a lot of changes to the demo ahead of Next Fest. I have listed below the more obvious changes but I assure you there have been many more behind the scenes! I continue to read every review along with the feedback form - Thank you to everyone who has kindly submitted ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:20:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692413","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2890610-1846651706679121","game_id":"steam-2890610","kind":"announcement","title":"Late Shift X Galaxies Showcase - Demo Out Now!","summary":"Hey everyone!Late Shift was selected to be on the Galaxies Autumn 2026 Showcase alongside many talented studios. A brand-new trailer for Late Shift was shown during the showcase which announced the release of the demo!The demo includes 19 unique anomalies and one ending. You can track how many unique anomalies you've found on the main menu. You must report the anomalies correctly in order for it to be counted. You cannot get repeated anomalies until you've reported them all. I highly recommend f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:45:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10: